  guideSlug: "how-to-make-a-small-living-room-look-bigger",
  guideTitle: "How to Make a Small Living Room Look Bigger Without Moving a Wall",
  metaTitle: "Make a Small Living Room Look Bigger",
  metaDescription: "Leggy furniture, mirror placement, high and wide curtain rods, a big enough rug and fewer larger pieces: practical ways to make a small living room feel bigger.",
  heroImage: "/images/articles/smallbigger-finland-studio-bright.webp",
